00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.810
Hmph! Why don't you try a date
with the laundry sometime?

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:54.970
Flat-head.

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:58.940
If only you were able to talk, Nanmo.
Then I'd be able to kill some time...

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:01.610
Nothing on Jobs Garou has come in, either...

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.580
Okay, that should do it.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.910
Nanmo, turn on the switch.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:13.520
Ow!

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:37.390
So, are you enjoying my company?

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:37.820
Yeah. You don't bother me by
